{
  "version": 1,
  "root": "C:\\KobeOS\\Models\\k9",
  "notes": [
    "Qwen is used by K9 but is not managed by the K9 downloader because it already exists under C:\\KobeOS\\Models.",
    "Logical agents share resident models; there is not one model process per agent.",
    "Heavy models must be lazy-loaded or served as resident workers according to available GPU memory."
